            // gh-922 review (PRRT_kwDORYAuYs6tR-c1): the `422` + any-`ref`
            // heuristic is shape-coupled — "refresh", "referer" and proxy
            // bodies quoting refs/… would park a LIVE PR after 3 ticks.
